      "text": "BOTH CHEQUES ARE WRITTEN IN\nTHE FINANCE PARTNER'S NAME\nThe non-cashable 2% commission cheque\nThe manager's cheque on transfer day",
      "originalText": "BOTH CHEQUES ARE WRITTEN IN\nTHE FINANCE PARTNER'S NAME\nThe non-cashable 2% commission cheque\nThe manager's cheque on transfer day",
